; The one variable: a GridMap whose MeshLibrary item is a PointMesh, in three cells: the first
; upright, the second turned a half turn about Y, the third one cell up and to the right. Godot
; lights a point, which has no normal array, as a +Z normal in node space, and the cell's basis
; turns it. The sun, shining toward -Z, lights the two upright points and not the turned one.
